@startuml

' 参与者定义
actor "用户" as User
participant "Bandit引擎" as Bandit
participant "检测规则" as Detector
participant "AST解析器" as Parser
participant "结果收集器" as Collector

' 样式设置
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteFontSize 12

title 漏洞扫描时序图

' 时序流程
User -> Bandit : bandit -r code.py
activate Bandit
note right of Bandit : 启动扫描，解析参数

Bandit -> Detector : 加载检测规则
activate Detector
Detector --> Bandit : 规则注册完成
deactivate Detector

Bandit -> Parser : 解析目标文件
activate Parser
Parser --> Bandit : 返回AST树
deactivate Parser

loop 遍历AST节点
    Bandit -> Detector : 触发检测规则
    activate Detector
    
    Detector --> Bandit : 返回Issue对象
    deactivate Detector
    
    Bandit -> Collector : 收集Issue
end

Bandit -> Collector : 生成报告
Collector --> Bandit : 格式化结果

Bandit --> User : 输出扫描结果
deactivate Bandit

@enduml